1, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 15\/11)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, os hor\u00e1rios e o local de partida do Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), com partida em frente \u00e0 Bas\u00edlica de S\u00e3o Torcato (Guimar\u00e3es) e chegada no Agrupamento de Escolas do Vale de S\u00e3o Torcato. O Trail 26 km parte \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Sprint 18 km \u00e0s 08:50, o Trail Jovem \/ Mini Trail 12 km \u00e0s 09:10 e a Caminhada 8 km \u00e0s 09:20.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis acumulados e barreiras hor\u00e1rias?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo pelo Trail Longo de 26 km (\u00b11200m D+, Grau 3 ATRP), Trail Sprint de 18 km (\u00b1950m D+, Grau 3 ATRP), Mini Trail \/ Trail Jovem de 12 km (\u00b1450m D+, Grau 2 ATRP) e Caminhada de 8 km. Existem barreiras hor\u00e1rias \u00e0s 2h00 de prova no 1\u00ba abastecimento (km 8) e \u00e0s 3h00 no 2\u00ba abastecimento (km 15), encerrando a meta \u00e0s 14:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases: na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 31 de outubro) custam 17 \u20ac nos 26 km, 14 \u20ac nos 18 km, 12 \u20ac nos 12 km e 10 \u20ac na Caminhada; na 2\u00aa fase (1 a 15 de novembro) custam 20 \u20ac nos 26 km, 18 \u20ac nos 18 km, 15 \u20ac nos 12 km e 12 \u20ac na Caminhada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Agrupamento de Escolas do Vale de S\u00e3o Torcato no s\u00e1bado, dia 21 de novembro, das 14:30 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, dia 22 de novembro, das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material recomendado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica da prova (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 1 de novembro), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lanche final, oferta finisher, seguro e banhos. Recomenda-se o transporte de telem\u00f3vel, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel, reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos e copo pr\u00f3prio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Bas\u00edlica de S\u00e3o Torcato, S\u00e3o Torcato\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Guimar\u00e3es\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, os hor\u00e1rios e o local de partida do Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026 realiza-se no dia 22 de novembro de 2026 (domingo), com partida em frente \u00e0 Bas\u00edlica de S\u00e3o Torcato (Guimar\u00e3es) e chegada no Agrupamento de Escolas do Vale de S\u00e3o Torcato. O Trail 26 km parte \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Sprint 18 km \u00e0s 08:50, o Trail Jovem \/ Mini Trail 12 km \u00e0s 09:10 e a Caminhada 8 km \u00e0s 09:20.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis acumulados e barreiras hor\u00e1rias?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento \u00e9 constitu\u00eddo pelo Trail Longo de 26 km (\u00b11200m D+, Grau 3 ATRP), Trail Sprint de 18 km (\u00b1950m D+, Grau 3 ATRP), Mini Trail \/ Trail Jovem de 12 km (\u00b1450m D+, Grau 2 ATRP) e Caminhada de 8 km. Existem barreiras hor\u00e1rias \u00e0s 2h00 de prova no 1\u00ba abastecimento (km 8) e \u00e0s 3h00 no 2\u00ba abastecimento (km 15), encerrando a meta \u00e0s 14:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail Vila de S. Torcato 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026 em duas fases: na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 31 de outubro) custam 17 \u20ac nos 26 km, 14 \u20ac nos 18 km, 12 \u20ac nos 12 km e 10 \u20ac na Caminhada; na 2\u00aa fase (1 a 15 de novembro) custam 20 \u20ac nos 26 km, 18 \u20ac nos 18 km, 15 \u20ac nos 12 km e 12 \u20ac na Caminhada.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Agrupamento de Escolas do Vale de S\u00e3o Torcato no s\u00e1bado, dia 21 de novembro, das 14:30 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo, dia 22 de novembro, das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual \u00e9 o material recomendado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica da prova (para inscri\u00e7\u00f5es at\u00e9 1 de novembro), abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lanche final, oferta finisher, seguro e banhos. Recomenda-se o transporte de telem\u00f3vel, manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, corta-vento\/imperme\u00e1vel, reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos e copo pr\u00f3prio.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70200,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51869","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-guimaraes-braga","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-vila-de-s-torcato.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51869","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable"